  sg-console --fullscreen         toggle full screen
  sg-console --new-tab            open a new tab
  sg-console --tall | --normal | --small | --float | --hide | --show

Docked at the bottom edge by the sg-shell GNOME extension (Wayland clients cannot
position themselves); floating when popped out; full screen when requested in tabbed mode.
